<span class="hc-a">⬡</span> <span class="hc-b">⬡</span> <span class="hc-a">⬡</span> <span class="hc-b">⬡</span> <span class="hc-a">⬡</span> <span class="hc-b">⬡</span> <span class="hc-a">⬡</span>
